WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Aero balance. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare front and rear force trends

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Aero balance compares where forces act and how they change. A total downforce number alone does not show front/rear stability.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Separate front and rear force readouts and compare their change across the same speed range.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Data interpretation

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Simplified flow picture; real values need test method and conditions.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare front and rear force trends
